{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 2.0, "text": "La mejor decisión que he tomado en los últimos años", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 2.0, "end_seconds": 4.0, "text": "es mantenerme en silencio", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 4.0, "end_seconds": 6.0, "text": "porque entiendes que no tienes nada que demostrar", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 6.0, "end_seconds": 8.0, "text": "no tienes que convencer a nadie", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 8.0, "end_seconds": 10.0, "text": "que eres la persona correcta", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 10.0, "end_seconds": 12.0, "text": "que eres la persona indicada", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 12.0, "end_seconds": 14.0, "text": "no tienes que arreglar lo que no has roto", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 14.0, "end_seconds": 16.0, "text": "y tampoco tienes que luchar para que alguien vea lo que vales", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 16.0, "end_seconds": 18.0, "text": "porque al final la gente va a creer lo que quiera", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 18.0, "end_seconds": 20.0, "text": "van a tergiversar, van a hablar, van a asumir cosas", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 20.0, "end_seconds": 22.0, "text": "y eso ya es problema suyo", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 22.0, "end_seconds": 24.0, "text": "pero el silencio", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 24.0, "end_seconds": 26.0, "text": "el silencio te da libertad", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 26.0, "end_seconds": 28.0, "text": "porque cuando dejas de explicarte", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 28.0, "end_seconds": 30.0, "text": "empiezas a avanzar", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 30.0, "end_seconds": 32.0, "text": "y avanzas libre, en paz, sin que nada te afecte", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 32.0, "end_seconds": 34.0, "text": "y lo que hagan los demás", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 34.0, "end_seconds": 36.0, "text": "es su elección", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 36.0, "end_seconds": 38.0, "text": "no puedes hacer nada al respecto", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 38.0, "end_seconds": 40.0, "text": "así que elige tu paz, deja de perseguir tus sombras", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 40.0, "end_seconds": 42.0, "text": "y camina hacia adelante", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OHMjihc3DmY", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 42.0, "end_seconds": 44.0, "text": "en silencio", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
